/// M10 CORE-015 "development sidecar: parser/project/native run shape".
/// Source: tests/integration/distribution_test.go symbol
/// TestDevelopmentSidecar (L19-357).
/// Related sources: the five staged native suites behind DELEGATE-001
/// (runtime/completion.test.ts), DELEGATE-002 (runtime/data.test.ts),
/// DELEGATE-003 (runtime/domain.test.ts), DELEGATE-004
/// (runtime/failure.test.ts) and DELEGATE-005 (runtime/primitive.test.ts);
/// every native behavior pin below cites its root test and line.
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): parser run shape (parse --render, inert http and
/// division needles, idempotent round-trip, obsolete grammar rejection
/// with span and kind); project run shape (inspect-project, relocation
/// stability, read-only inspection, stale-lock rejection with its dirtied
/// path); declaration run shape (inspect-types, the infinite record, the
/// finite-inhabitant rejection); staged native invocation (bun test with
/// hermetic flags, runtime bunfig, five suite paths, four pass needles);
/// and one load-bearing pin per delegated declaration (5 data + 4
/// primitive + 6 failure + 9 domain + 7 completion).
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): the Go staged pass needles
/// (2/4/11/5 pass at L236/L246/L256/L266) are pinned verbatim while the
/// statically counted declarations differ (5/4/15/7 across the same
/// suites); the delta stays flagged for current-contract relevance
/// review per each delegate delete_when, never waived.
/// Sidecar build/launcher/mutation semantics live in
/// core-015-sidecar-semantics.can; static fixture and delegate
/// inventories live in core-015-roots-green.can.
/// Variants: parser, project, declaration, native data/primitives/
/// failures/completions facets.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS arm64 + sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/BUILD/
/// ARCHIVE/ENV/DIAG and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run
/// now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L33).
/// Delegated oracles: DELEGATE-001..005 as above (31 declarations total);
/// recorded read-only with sha256 in evidence, not executed.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QF2 unmet).
/// Case dist/run checks: parse-command, render-flag, needle-http, 
/// needle-div, idempotent, obsolete-source, obsolete-span, 
/// obsolete-kind, inspect-command, relocation-stable, 
/// inspect-readonly, vendor-path, stale-needle, types-command, 
/// infinite-record, uninhabited-needle, native-subcommand, 
/// bun-no-env-file, bun-no-macros, bun-no-install, bun-config, 
/// suite-data, suite-primitive, suite-failure, suite-domain, 
/// suite-completion, pass-data, pass-primitive, pass-failures, 
/// pass-completion, data-eq-nominal, data-opaque-copy, 
/// data-opaque-iter, data-opaque-dup, data-copy-aliases, prim-bigint, 
/// prim-index, prim-slice, prim-sweep, fail-describe, fail-scalar, 
/// fail-origin, fail-messages, fail-adapter, fail-synthetic, 
/// dom-occurrences, dom-payloads, dom-plan, dom-lineage, 
/// dom-recursive, dom-factories, dom-precedence, dom-digest, 
/// dom-rejected, comp-assimilation, comp-void, comp-forged, comp-keys, 
/// comp-admission, comp-hostile, comp-boundary.
/// Facet map (distribution_test.go legs plus native roots): parse-command
/// pins parse and render-flag pins --render (L98); needle-http pins
/// http::must_not_run and needle-div pins 1 / 0 (L108); idempotent pins
/// the byte-identical re-render (L113-116); obsolete-source pins extern
/// fn obsolete (L117); obsolete-span pins :4: and obsolete-kind pins
/// syntax: (L119); inspect-command pins inspect-project (L126);
/// relocation-stable pins the relocation-identical report (L190-192);
/// inspect-readonly pins the write-free inspection (L193-195);
/// vendor-path pins vendor/sample/src/shared.can (L196); stale-needle
/// pins stale dependency digest (L203); types-command pins inspect-types
/// (L210); infinite-record pins record infinite (L222);
/// uninhabited-needle pins finite inhabitant (L224); native-subcommand
/// pins test and bun-no-env-file/macros/install pin the hermetic flags
/// with bun-config pinning tools/runtime/bunfig.toml (L232);
/// suite-data/primitive/failure/domain/completion pin the five staged
/// paths (L232/L243/L252/L252/L263); pass-data pins 2 pass (L236);
/// pass-primitive pins 4 pass (L246); pass-failures pins 11 pass (L256);
/// pass-completion pins 5 pass (L266); data-eq-nominal pins
/// root/a::item<int> (data.test.ts L5); data-opaque-copy pins opaque
/// contents already registered (L38); data-opaque-iter pins iterable
/// consumed twice (L49); data-opaque-dup pins must not iterate (L92);
/// data-copy-aliases pins __proto__ (L117); prim-bigint pins arithmetic
/// (primitive.test.ts L19); prim-index pins bounds (L39); prim-slice pins
/// -3n (L51); prim-sweep pins 10 (L68: -10 to 10); fail-describe pins
/// native object (failure.test.ts L42); fail-scalar pins native symbol
/// (L77); fail-origin pins app::run (L17); fail-messages pins arithmetic:
/// integer division by zero (L123); fail-adapter pins native failure
/// (L166); fail-synthetic pins assertion: missing fixture (L181);
/// dom-occurrences pins undeclared escaping (domain.test.ts L87);
/// dom-payloads pins invalid domain error payload (L155); dom-plan pins
/// catalogue declaration mismatch (L197); dom-lineage pins
/// can.project.lineage/shop_left/model::failed (L253); dom-recursive pins
/// can.project.root::app::tree (L278); dom-factories pins app::mutated
/// (L316); dom-precedence pins concrete failure type identity mismatch
/// (L349); dom-digest pins createDomainRuntimeWithDigest (L367);
/// dom-rejected pins identity mismatch (L393); comp-assimilation pins
/// assimilated data (completion.test.ts L52); comp-void pins broken
/// (L75); comp-forged pins standard (L100); comp-keys pins kind (L126);
/// comp-admission pins ok, the forged getter kind refused without
/// invocation (L158/L171); comp-hostile pins assimilated getter (L215);
/// comp-boundary pins can:adapter (L239).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.

